"""Survey expectations, extracted on 14-Oct-2026 from the official sources (median responses).

Real-time availability (what was public at the end of month t):
  - Banxico Survey of Private Sector Economists (Encuesta sobre las Expectativas de los Especialistas en Economia
    del Sector Privado). The survey of month m is published on the first business days of month m+1, so at the
    end of month t only the survey of month t-1 is used.
      * Policy (interbank funding) rate expected at the close of the current quarter and the next five quarters.
        Banxico SIE, table CR168 (median), available from August 2010.
      * 10-year Bono M yield expected at the close of the current year and the next three years.
        Banxico SIE, table CR189 (median), available from July 2013.
  - Philadelphia Fed Survey of Professional Forecasters, 10-year Treasury yield (TBOND), median, quarterly.
    TBOND2 = current-quarter average, TBOND3..TBOND6 = one to four quarters ahead. The survey of quarter q is
    released in the middle of the quarter's second month, so it is used from the end of that month.
    Source: https://www.philadelphiafed.org/surveys-and-data/tbond (Median_TBOND_Level.xlsx).
"""
